The [[Glowing Crown]] is a godly [[Helmet]] available in the shop for all classes. Occasionally, it cleanses a {{icon/blind}} and heals a bit. Once the player has 10 {{icon/mana}}, the [[Glowing Crown]] will spend it to grant invulnerability for 2s, which could prevent a lot of damage.

Consider the synergy with {{icon/blind}} self-inflicting items such as [[Sir Sand]] and [[Blazing Spear]]. It takes quite a bit of {{icon/mana}} to activate its most impactful aspect, so have some {{icon/mana}} sources around to get the most out of it.

There are multiple crafts using the [[Glowing Crown]]:

Combining the [[Glowing Crown]] with a [[Box of Riches]] grants a [[King Crown]], which has enhanced [[Glowing Crown]] effects in addition to enhancing the gemstones it contains.

Combining the [[Glowing Crown]] with a [[Spear]] grants a [[Holy Spear]], which is a powerful enhanced spear that costs very little stamina, does good damage, destroys {{icon/block}}, cleanses debuffs, and even has an improved [[Glowing Crown]] invincibility ability that also doubles the [[Holy Spear]]'s attack speed.

Finally, [[Reaper]]s can combine a [[Glowing Crown]] with a [[Toad]] to create a [[Frog Prince]], which is roughly a larger, better [[Toad]] with some [[Glowing Crown]] abilities. Notably, the invulnerability on this one is triggered by other items using 30 buffs, which might not always be as easy as the [[Glowing Crown]]'s '''Use 10''' {{icon/mana}}.
